WEBVTT

00:08:59.917 --> 00:09:03.309
I asked Patrick what his favorite
line was, and he said,

00:09:03.333 --> 00:09:06.875
"We will be no older than we ever were."

00:09:08.375 --> 00:09:12.809
He said it reminded him
of a place where time just stops,

00:09:12.833 --> 00:09:15.768
where time doesn't matter anymore.

00:09:15.792 --> 00:09:17.851
And I asked him
if he had a place like that,

00:09:17.875 --> 00:09:20.268
where time lasts forever.

00:09:20.292 --> 00:09:21.958
And he said, "My mother."

00:09:23.875 --> 00:09:28.184
When you read a poem
alongside someone else,

00:09:28.208 --> 00:09:30.083
the poem changes in meaning.